{"version":1,"id":"lee-brice-one-of-them-girls","title":"One Of Them Girls","artist":"Lee Brice","key":"E","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/lee-brice/one-of-them-girls/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Lee Brice","chords":[{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"B","canonical":"B","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,3,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C#m","canonical":"C#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,4,8],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A","canonical":"A","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,1,4],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Intro]","columns":20,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":11,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#m","column":14,"beat":4},{"symbol":"A","column":19,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Are you one of them girls that peels off the Bud Light label?","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":20,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":55,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"Just might run a pool table?","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Roll your eyes if I call you an angel, ain't you one of them girls?","columns":67,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":32,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":61,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"Ask you to dance, you say \"No\" just to see how far I'll go","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":22,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":51,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Your song comes on and your eyes close, that's when I know, yeah","columns":65,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":28,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":64,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"You got your heart on lock down, got a wall I gotta knock down","columns":65,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":31,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":62,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Kinda wanna do a shot now, come on now","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":25,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"And you're one of them girls that ain't tryna meet nobody","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":23,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":53,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"You're just here for the party, if I'm wrong then stop me, yeah","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":25,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":50,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"You're one of them girls that ain't handin' out your number","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":53,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"You like to make us want you, you like to make us wonder","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":20,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":50,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"If you're one of them girls, 'cause I'm one of them boys","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":22,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":52,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Would trade his whole world, hm, yeah","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":22,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"For one of them girls who likes to act all quiet, sexy, not even tryin'","columns":71,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":43,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#m","column":65,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, you know I ain't lyin', damn right","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbo